---
import { siteConfig } from '../../config/site';
import MediaPlaceholder from '../ui/MediaPlaceholder.astro';
---

<section class="section season scene-dark" id="season" data-section="season">
  <div class="section-shell season-shell">
    <header class="section-heading season-heading" data-reveal>
      <p class="eyebrow">01 / CURRENT SEASON</p>
      <h2>{siteConfig.season.name}</h2>
      <p class="display-subtitle">{siteConfig.season.theme}</p>
    </header>
    <div class="season-content">
      <div class="season-copy" data-reveal>
        <p class="large-copy">每一个赛季，都是一次从任务理解到场地验证的完整工程过程。</p>
        <p>
          电控组正在参与 2027 赛季准备。公开网站仅介绍赛事背景和团队方向。
        </p>
        <dl class="data-list">
          <div><dt>STATUS</dt><dd>PREPARING</dd></div>
          <div><dt>DISCLOSURE</dt><dd>CAPABILITY ONLY</dd></div>
          <div><dt>DETAILS</dt><dd>INTERNAL</dd></div>
        </dl>
      </div>
      <div data-reveal>
        <MediaPlaceholder code="SEASON_VISUAL / 01" label="ROBOCON 2027 VISUAL" note="官方赛季素材待审核后替换" dark />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
